@startuml
title FEQ-D06 Mismatch Manual Review Closure Flow
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Mismatch or repeated unknown outcome detected;
:Assign exception to support/compliance role;
:Review Central PMS original request and evidence;
:Review POS Server readback result and fiscal evidence;

if (Evidence matches original request?) then (yes)
  :Record Central PMS fiscal reference evidence\nthrough approved backend workflow;
  :Mark reconciled;
elseif (Retry is safe and eligible?) then (yes)
  :Approve controlled retry request;
  :Return to retry workflow;
elseif (Configuration fix required?) then (yes)
  :Mark blocked_requires_config_fix;
  :Assign to configuration owner;
elseif (Escalation required?) then (yes)
  :Escalate to compliance/accounting/engineering;
  :Keep manual_review_required;
elseif (Superseded/cancelled?) then (yes)
  :Mark cancelled_superseded with reason;
else (unrecoverable)
  :Close as unrecoverable with evidence and approval;
endif

:Audit decision, role, reason, evidence reference;
:Publish Operator Console visibility update;
:Publish Management Dashboard projection update;
:Manual review does not fabricate fiscal documents\nor mutate POS Server fiscal numbering;
stop
@enduml
